      "parameters": {
        "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"th\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <title>✅ เพิ่มผู้ใช้งานสำเร็จ</title>\n  <style>\n    body {\n      font-family: \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif;\n      background: #f4f6f9;\n      padding: 40px;\n      text-align: center;\n      color: #333;\n    }\n    .card {\n      display: inline-block;\n      background: white;\n      border-radius: 16px;\n      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\n      padding: 24px 40px;\n      max-width: 480px;\n      text-align: left;\n      animation: fadeIn 0.6s ease;\n    }\n    h1 {\n      color: #2ecc71;\n      font-size: 1.6rem;\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n    table {\n      width: 100%;\n      border-collapse: collapse;\n      margin-top: 20px;\n    }\n    td {\n      padding: 8px 0;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;\n    }\n    td:first-child {\n      color: #777;\n      width: 40%;\n    }\n    .footer {\n      margin-top: 20px;\n      font-size: 0.9rem;\n      color: #888;\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n    @keyframes fadeIn {\n      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); }\n      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <h1>✅ เพิ่มผู้ใช้งานเรียบร้อยแล้ว</h1>\n    <table>\n      <tr><td><b>👤 ชื่อผู้ใช้</b></td><td>{{ $json.user_id }}</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><b>🔑 API Key</b></td><td><code>{{ $json.api_key }}</code></td></tr>\n      <tr><td><b>📊 Limit</b></td><td>{{ $json.limit }}</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><b>📈 Used</b></td><td>{{ $json.used }}</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><b>📅 วันที่สร้าง</b></td><td>{{ $json.date_created }}</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><b>⏳ หมดอายุ</b></td><td>{{ $json.date_last_used }}</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><b>⚙️ สถานะ</b></td><td>{{ $json.is_active }}</td></tr>\n      <tr><td><b>📝 Note</b></td><td>{{ $json.note }}</td></tr>\n    </table>\n    <div class=\"footer\">\n      <p>📁 ข้อมูลนี้ถูกบันทึกใน Google Sheet เรียบร้อยแล้ว</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>\n